    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n73942" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὀμφᾰκ-ίτης</span></b> 
		<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">[ῑ]</span> (sc. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">οἶνος</span>), ὁ, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b>
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὀμφακίας</span>
			, <i><span class="en">
				Dsc.
				5.6
			</span></i> ; epith. of Dionysus, <i><span class="en">
				Ael.
				<u>VH</u>
				3.41
			</span></i> ; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λίθος,</span> name of a green
			stone, prob. for <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὀμφατίτης</span> in <i><span class="en">
				Gal.
				12.207
			</span></i> :—fem. <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὀμφᾰκ-ῖτις</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ιδος</span>, as
				Adj., <i>unripe,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐλαίη</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hp.
					<u>Mul.</u>
					2.195
				</span></i>
			 : as Subst., <i>Aleppo gall,</i> gall of
				<i>Quercus infectoria,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Dsc.
				1.107
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Gal.
				8.114
			</span></i>.</div>
